ion":"NONE","body":"Hi! I'd like to work on this bounty. \n\n**My Plan:**\n- Analyze the requirements\n- Implement the solution\n- Submit PR within 24-48 hours\n\n**Payment Address:**\n- Platform: OKX\n- Token: USDT (TRC20)\n- Address: `TGu4W5T6q4KvLAbmXmZSRpUBNRCxr2aFTP`\n\nLet's get this done! 🚀","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:00:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139804443","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wHG2","author":{"login":"TateLyman"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nImplementing the n8n + Claude Code workflow. Experienced with both tools. PR incoming.","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:01:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139807158","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wUlu","author":{"login":"zhuzhushiwojia"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am interested in this bounty. I have experience with n8n workflows, Claude API integration, and GitHub automation. I can create a complete n8n workflow that fetches GitHub activity, generates narrative summaries via Claude API, and delivers via email/Discord. I will include exportable .json workflow, setup instructions, and test screenshots.","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:18:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139862382","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wkAJ","author":{"login":"ljapptest-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:39:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139925513","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wkAP","author":{"login":"ljapptest-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 🔄 n8n Workflow Submission\n\nI've created a complete n8n workflow for generating weekly GitHub summaries with Claude AI.\n\n### ✅ Deliverables\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/n8n-weekly-summary\n\n### ✅ Acceptance Criteria Met\n\n- [x] **Exportable n8n workflow**: `n8n-workflow.json` (importable)\n- [x] **Weekly cron trigger**: Friday at 5 PM (`0 17 * * 5`)\n- [x] **GitHub API**: Fetches commits, closed issues, merged PRs\n- [x] **Claude API**: Uses `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` for narrative generation\n- [x] **Multiple delivery**: Email AND Discord webhook (both supported)\n- [x] **Configurable**: Environment variables for repo, channel, language (EN/FR)\n- [x] **README**: 5-step setup instructions\n\n### 📦 What's Included\n\n**Workflow Features**:\n- Schedule Trigger (weekly cron)\n- GitHub API nodes (commits, issues, PRs)\n- Code node for data processing\n- Claude API node for narrative generation\n- Email delivery node\n- Discord webhook delivery node\n\n**Configuration**:\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `GITHUB_REPO` | Target repository |\n| `GITHUB_TOKEN` | GitHub Personal Access Token |\n| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Claude API key |\n| `LANGUAGE` | EN or FR |\n| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | Discord webhook (optional) |\n| `EMAIL_RECIPIENT` | Email recipient (optional) |\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Import workflow\nn8n import:workflow --input=n8n-workflow.json\n\n# 2. Configure credentials\n# Add GitHub Token and Claude API key in n8n\n\n# 3. Set environment variables\nexport GITHUB_REPO=owner/repo\nexport ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxx\n\n# 4. Activate workflow\n# Click \"Active\" toggle in n8n\n\n# 5. Test\n# Click \"Execute Workflow\" to test manually\n```\n\n### 📋 Sample Output\n\n```markdown\n# Weekly Summary: owner/repo\n\n## Introduction\nThis week saw 23 commits, 5 issues closed, and 3 PRs merged.\n\n## Highlights\n- Major feature: New authentication system\n- Performance improvements in API routes\n\n## Technical Details\n- Added JWT-based authentication (+450 lines)\n- Refactored database queries for 40% speed improvement\n\n## Next Steps\n- Continue with OAuth integration\n```\n\n### 🌐 Workflow Diagram\n\n```\nWeekly Trigger → GitHub API → Process Data → Claude API → Email/Discord\n```\n\n### 🔗 Links\n\n- **Code**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/n8n-weekly-summary\n- **Workflow**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/n8n-weekly-summary/blob/main/n8n-workflow.json\n- **README**: https://github.com/ljapptest-art/n8n-weekly-summary/blob/main/README.md\n\nReady for review! 🎉","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:39:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139925519","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wleY","author":{"login":"zhuzhushiwojia"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I'd like to claim this $200 bounty.\n\n**Approach**: I'll create a complete n8n workflow with GitHub API integration and Claude API for narrative summaries.\n\n**Experience**: Experienced with n8n workflows, GitHub API, and Claude API integration.\n\n**Timeline**: Will submit PR within 2-3 days.\n\n**Payment**: Please send to TMLkvEDrjvHEUbWYU1jfqyUKmbLNZkx6T1 (USDT TRC20)","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:41:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4139931544","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M72wxBa","author":{"login":"asdas6wdqc"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this bounty. I'll implement the n8n workflow for weekly dev summaries.","createdAt":"2026-03-27T03:58:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"mi