ow, integrating the GitHub API for weekly activity with Claude (`claude-sonnet-4-20250514`) for narrative summaries. I'll ensure all acceptance criteria are met, including the cron trigger, configurable variables, and a comprehensive README for setup. I will comment `/opire try` and submit a PR promptly with the `.json` workflow.","createdAt":"2026-05-18T17:21:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4480118062","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC0HwMg","author":{"login":"1150654748m-dev"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T02:13:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4483838002","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC0Ml3g","author":{"login":"2569658930"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nn8n workflow: 10-node pipeline for weekly dev summaries.\n- Cron trigger (Friday 5pm)\n- Fetches commits, closed issues, merged PRs from GitHub API\n- Builds Claude prompt → sonnet-4 generates narrative summary\n- Delivers via Discord webhook (swap for email/Slack)\n- Fully importable JSON\n\nPR incoming.","createdAt":"2026-05-19T02:32:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4483917278","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC07Z3Q","author":{"login":"xlocalvn-svg"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T05:24:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4484684253","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC1zZhQ","author":{"login":"Adamchaua"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T07:55:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4485601669","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC2RyhQ","author":{"login":"Adamchaua"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T08:58:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4486099589","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC2YidQ","author":{"login":"gacorpoll-ui"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt\n\n## 📋 Proposal — n8n + Claude Code Weekly Dev Summary\n\n**Contributor:** [@gacorpoll-ui](https://github.com/gacorpoll-ui)\n\n### Approach\n\nI will build a complete, production-ready n8n workflow that:\n\n1. **Trigger**: Weekly cron (configurable, default Friday 5pm UTC)\n2. **GitHub Data Fetch**: Uses GitHub API nodes to collect:\n   - Commits from the past 7 days\n   - Closed issues with labels and assignees\n   - Merged PRs with reviewers and diff stats\n3. **Claude API Integration**: Sends structured data to `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` with a narrative prompt that generates a human-readable weekly summary\n4. **Delivery**: Discord webhook + optional email (both documented)\n5. **Configurable Variables**: Repo owner/name, webhook URL, language (EN/FR), summary style\n\n### Deliverables\n- `workflow.json` — importable n8n workflow file\n- `README.md` — 5-step setup guide\n- Screenshot of successful execution on real n8n instance\n- Test data and example output\n\n### Why Me\n- Already built a CHANGELOG generator skill for this repo (merged PR)\n- Built pre-tool-use hook (merged PR)  \n- Built CLAUDE.md template (merged PR)\n- Experienced with GitHub Actions automation and CI/CD workflows\n- Built API benchmark suites with similar data aggregation patterns\n\n### Timeline\n24-48 hours from claim to PR submission.\n\n---\n*Contributor: gacorpoll-ui | [Upwork](https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~01ca8ad8ce36b9eceb)*","createdAt":"2026-05-19T09:11:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4486210165","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC3UD5Q","author":{"login":"arthurus36-alt"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5","createdAt":"2026-05-19T11:15:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4487185381","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC4VPyg","author":{"login":"niufox"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T13:31:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4488253386","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC4YyGg","author":{"login":"shijiezhichang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T13:37:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4488311322","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABC4xLog","author":{"login":"Adamchaua"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-19T14:21:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4488711074"