dy":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T05:33:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527507721","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDdxMmg","author":{"login":"amitwaks"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T05:34:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527508634","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeDGHg","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:09:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527801886","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeEosw","author":{"login":"pterking"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## ✅ Delivery Submitted — [@pterking](https://github.com/pterking)\n\n### 📦 n8n Weekly GitHub Dev Summary — Automated Narrative Summaries via Claude API\n\n**PR:** [#2051](https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2051)\n\n**Files:**\n- `deliverables/n8n-weekly-summary/workflow.json` (n8n workflow, 15.2 KB)\n- `deliverables/n8n-weekly-summary/README.md` (Setup guide, 6.4 KB)\n\n### Workflow (11 Nodes)\n\n```\nWeekly Cron (Fri 5 PM) → Calculate Week Dates\n  → Fetch Commits / Closed Issues / Merged PRs (parallel)\n  → Aggregate Data (top contributors, key changes)\n  → Generate Summary (Claude 3.5 Sonnet)\n  → Format Output → Discord / Slack / Console\n```\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n\n| Criterion | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Exportable n8n workflow (.json) | ✅ |\n| Weekly cron trigger (Fri 5 PM) | ✅ `0 17 * * 5` |\n| Fetch commits, issues, PRs | ✅ 3 parallel requests |\n| Claude API (claude-3-5-sonnet) | ✅ |\n| Discord/Slack delivery | ✅ Both + console log |\n| Configurable (repo, language, webhooks) | ✅ |\n| README ≤5 steps | ✅ |\n\n### Setup (5 Steps)\n\n1. Import `workflow.json` into n8n\n2. Configure GitHub API + Anthropic API credentials\n3. Set variables: repo, language, webhook URL(s)\n4. Activate the workflow\n5. Test with Execute Workflow\n\n### Workflow Validation\n\n- ✅ Valid JSON — 11 nodes, 8 connections\n- ✅ Proper data flow verified\n- ✅ All nodes use standard n8n node types\n\n---\n🤖 Delivered by **Atlas Bounty Hunter**\n","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:20:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527827123","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeE2yg","author":{"login":"Ishant5436"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:22:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527830730","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeIkKg","author":{"login":"aglichandrap"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:52:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527891498","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeLquA","author":{"login":"amitwaks"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T09:15:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4527942328","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDey2ww","author":{"login":"duongynhi000005-oss"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T12:16:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4528584387","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDf_3hw","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try - submitting n8n weekly dev summary workflow. Payout: 0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658","createdAt":"2026-05-24T20:14:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4529846151","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDjHt8Q","author":{"login":"Karry2019web"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI'll build this n8n workflow with GitHub API + Claude API integration, weekly cron trigger, and Discord webhook delivery. PR incoming.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T09:21:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4533120497","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDjINvg","author":{"login":"Karry2019web"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR submitted for Bounty #5:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2092\n\nComplete n8n workflow with multi-language support (EN/FR), multiple delivery options (Discord/Slack/Email), and env-var configuration.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T09:23:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4533128638","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDjI6yw","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Approach\n\n1. **Build an n8n workflow** with a weekly cron trigger (Friday 5pm) that calls the GitHub REST API to fetch commits, closed issues, and merged PRs from the past 7 days.\n2. **Aggregate the data** into a structured prompt and send it to the Claude API (`claude-sonnet-4-20250514`) to generate a narrative summary in the configured language (EN/FR).\n3. **Deliver via Discord webhook** (simplest to set up, no SMTP config). Slack also supported via a toggle in the config node.\n4. **All configurable values** (repo owner/name, webhook URL, language, API keys) are centralized in a single \"Config\" node for easy editing.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- `workflow.json` — importable n8n workflow file\n- `README.md` — setup in ≤5 steps (install workflow, set credentials, configure variables, activate, verify)\n- Screenshot of successful execution on a live n8n instance\n- Documentation of all configurable variables\n\n## ETA\n\n3 days from claim\n\n## Payout Address (Base)\n\n`0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-25T09:24:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4533140171","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDkFy_Q","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T12:09:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4534137597","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDk3s4A","author":{"login":"sureshchouksey8"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T14:18:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4534955232","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDsoiXQ","author":{"login":"ybbuge2537"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T09:56:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4543095389","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtf3CQ","author":{"login":"Thanhdn1984"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:18:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4544001801","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtljkQ","author":{"login":"totoxu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this $200 bounty. I've submitted PR #1911 which includes:\n- CHANGELOG skill (#1)\n- Desructive hook (#3)\n- PR reviewer agent (#4)\n\nFor #5 n8n workflow: I can build a complete n8n workflow that integrates with Claude Code for weekly dev summaries. Let me know if you want me to submit a separate PR for the n8n workflow or if PR #1911 coverage can be expanded.\n\n**Payment Address:** RTC wallet pending (waiting for setup confirmation from @Scottcjn)","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:40:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4544095121","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtou3Q","author":{"login":"totoxu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Update: n8n workflow (weekly-dev-summary-v2.json) has been pushed to PR #1911 along with all other bounty deliverables (#1/#3/#4). The workflow includes:\n\n- Friday 5pm cron trigger\n- GitHub API: commits + closed issues + merged PRs\n- Claude Sonnet 4: narrative summary generation\n- Dual delivery: Discord webhook OR Email\n- Configurable: REPO, GITHUB_TOKEN, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, LANGUAGE\n- README with 5-step setup\n\nPR: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/1911","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:51:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4544147165","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDyTqCQ","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T21:24:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4549044745","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0du3Q","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I've read through the issue and I'm clear on what's needed. I'll deliver an importable n8n workflow JSON that handles the full pipeline: weekly cron trigger → GitHub API calls (commits, closed issues, merged PRs via the Search/REST nodes) → Claude API call using `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` for narrative generation → delivery via Discord webhook (with Slack as a documented toggle). All configurable variables (repo owner/name, webhook URL, language selection) will be surfaced as workflow variables for easy editing.\n\nA few implementation details I'm planning: I'll use the HTTP Request node for GitHub API calls since n8n's built-in GitHub node has rate-limit quirks with pagination on search endpoints. For the Claude call, I'll use the HTTP Request node against the Anthropic Messages API with proper `x-api-key` header and `anthropic-version` header. The language toggle (EN/FR) will be injected into the system prompt. I'll handle the edge case where a repo has zero activity in a given week so the summary doesn't break.\n\nDeliverables: the `.json` workflow file, a 