2k"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## PR Submitted: #2356\n\nI've submitted a complete n8n workflow that meets all acceptance criteria:\n\n✅ **Exportable workflow** — claude-builders-bounty-workflow.json  \n✅ **Weekly cron** — Friday 5pm UTC  \n✅ **GitHub API integration** — commits, issues, PRs  \n✅ **Claude Sonnet API** — narrative summaries  \n✅ **Multi-delivery** — Discord webhook + Email (Resend)  \n✅ **Configurable** — repo, language (EN/FR) via env vars  \n✅ **5-step README** — Complete setup guide  \n\n### Features\n- Bilingual summaries (English/French)\n- Proper error handling & logging\n- Fully configured nodes, ready to import\n- All GitHub API & Claude API credentials integrated\n\n### PR: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2356\n\nReady for review. Looking forward to the merge and automatic payment via Opire! 🚀","createdAt":"2026-05-31T05:07:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4585765505","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEVVMdg","author":{"login":"sadrichboy888-snakebot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"\"¡Hola equipo! Estoy interesado en resolver este desafío. Con experiencia en n8n y Claude API, creo que puedo crear un flujo de trabajo sólido que automatice la generación de una resumen semanal de actividad en GitHub. ¿Puedo postularme con /opire try? 🤔\"","createdAt":"2026-05-31T05:09:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4585770102","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEVliZA","author":{"login":"hikali123456789"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:19:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[