ive submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending from me unless maintainers request a specific change.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T02:24:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4872044541","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIn5Pzg","author":{"login":"cashmeout2313"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-03T07:13:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4873670606","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIn9K6w","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-issue PR #3173 from @cashmeout2313:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/3173\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now: PR #2691 is open, non-draft, MERGEABLE/CLEAN, authored by me, and its body includes `/claim #5` and `Closes #5`. No failed or pending checks are reported.\n\nPR #3173 is newer same-issue activity, but it does not replace the earlier active #5 claim/submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending from my side unless maintainers request a specific change.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T07:19:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4873734891","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIsNweA","author":{"login":"scotia1973-bot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdA