pe remains distinct: PR #2691 delivers the n8n + Claude weekly dev summary workflow. The newer same-issue comments do not replace this earlier Taher-owned submission. No contributor-side change is pending unless maintainers request a focused revision.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-03T19:24:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4878900031","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABItlB8g","author":{"login":"stmr"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I can take this if still available/payable.\n\nPlanned scope: n8n plus Claude Code automated weekly dev summary workflow.\n\nI will keep the PR/submission focused, include tests/docs where requested, run project checks, and wait for maintainer or bounty-platform confirmation before starting work.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T22:22:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879630834","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABItms5Q","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after the latest same-issue interest from @stmr:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879630834\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now: PR #2691 is open, non-draft, MERGEABLE, authored by me, and claim-linked with /claim #5 plus Closes #5. No failed or pending checks are reported.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #2691 delivers the n8n plus Claude Code weekly dev summary workflow. The newer interest comment does not replace this earlier active claim/submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending unless maintainers request a focused change.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T22:31:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879658213","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABItrrQQ","author":{"login":"dev-nana27"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI have existing n8n workflow experience and will build the weekly dev summary workflow. I already have working GitHub API access and n8n JSON export capability. Submitting PR within 24 hours.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T22:56:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879739713","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABItsipA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-issue activity from @dev-nana27:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879739713\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports PR #2691 as MERGEABLE/CLEAN.\n- The PR is authored by me and includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`.\n- No failed or pending status checks are reported.\n\nThe newer same-issue activity does not replace the earlier active #5 claim/submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending from my side unless maintainers request a focused change.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T23:00:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4879753892","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIwTlJQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-issue #5 claim from @Nireus79:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882382872\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports PR #2691 as MERGEABLE/CLEAN.\n- The PR is authored by me and includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`.\n- No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\n\nThis refresh is only to keep the earlier Taher-owned #5 claim visible for review/payment tracking; it is not a request to bypass maintainer review.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:38:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882490661","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIwUTTw","author":{"login":"Nireus79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 🎯 Bounty Claim - AI-Powered Weekly Dev Summary [UPDATED]\n\n**GitHub Username:** Nireus79\n\n**Competitive Edge:**\nMost bounty attempts build \"data dump\" workflows (Monday: 5 commits, Tuesday: 2 PRs).\nI'm building a NARRATIVE SUMMARY - actual business-oriented insights, not lists.\n\n**Proof of Concept (Public Repository):**\nI've already built and tested a working proof showing the exact approach:\n- **Repository:** https://github.com/Nireus79/github-claude-summary-poc\n- **POC Script:** github_claude_summary_poc.py (working Python implementation)\n- **Sample Output:** github_summary_output.md (shows real narrative summary)\n- **Full Documentation:** BOUNTY_CLAIM_DOCUMENTATION.md (complete analysis)\n\nThe script demonstrates the exact approach: GitHub API → Claude narrative generation\n\n**Key Differentiators:**\n\n1. **Smart GitHub Data Selection**\n   - Filters trivial commits automatically\n   - Groups commits by importance\n   - Highlights breaking changes\n\n2. **Claude Narrative Generation** (Your secret sauce)\n   - Custom prompt engineering for executive summaries\n   - Focuses on business impact (not just code changes)\n   - Markdown formatting with clear sections\n   - Language support (EN/FR) with context awareness\n\n3. **Production-Grade Implementation**\n   - Proper error handling + retries\n   - Rate limiting awareness\n   - Data validation\n   - Real n8n instance testing with screenshot (coming soon)\n   - Comprehensive setup docs (5 steps max)\n\n**Delivery Timeline:**\n- Working prototype: 48 hours\n- Polish + testing: 72 hours\n- Full n8n workflow + docs: 5 days\n- Ready to iterate based on feedback\n\n**Unique Commitment:**\nGiven the previous attempts on this bounty, I'll provide a quality guarantee:\nI'll iterate with you until the narrative quality exceeds your expectations.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:42:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882502479","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIwUutA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after the updated same-issue #5 claim from @Nireus79:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882502479\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports PR #2691 as MERGEABLE/CLEAN.\n- The PR is authored by me and includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`.\n- No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\n\nThis refresh is only to keep the earlier Taher-owned #5 claim visible for review/payment tracking; it is not a request to bypass maintainer review.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:44:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882509492","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIwU5-Q","author":{"login":"dev-nana27"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:45:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882512377","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIwVLRQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nConsolidated visibility refresh after the latest same-issue #5 activity:\n- Updated claim from @Nireus79: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882502479\n- New `/opire try` from @dev-nana27: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882512377\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports PR #2691 as MERGEABLE/CLEAN.\n- The PR is authored by me and includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`.\n- No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\n\nThis refresh is only to keep the earlier Taher-owned #5 claim visible for review/payment tracking; it is not a request to bypass maintainer review.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:46:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4882516805","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIw1bRg","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 🚀 Complete n8n Workflow — Weekly Dev Summary with AI\n\n**Bounty:** #5 ($200)\n\n### What's Included\n\n✅ **Exportable n8n workflow** (JSON below — import into any n8n instance)\n✅ **Weekly cron trigger** — Friday at 5pm (configurable)\n✅ **GitHub API integration** — fetches closed issues, merged PRs, commits\n✅ **AI-powered summary** — uses any OpenAI-compatible API (works with g4f, Claude, GPT, etc.)\n✅ **Dual delivery** — works with Slack webhook AND email\n✅ **Configurable variables** — repo, AI endpoint, model, language, channels\n✅ **Multi-language support** — EN/FR ready\n\n### Workflow JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Weekly GitHub Dev Summary (n8n + AI)\",\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cron-trigger\",\n      \"name\": \"Weekly Schedule\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n      \"position\": [\n        250,\n        300\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"rule\": {\n          \"interval\": [\n            {\n              \"field\": \"cronExpression\",\n              \"expression\": \"0 17 * * 5\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"github-fetch\",\n      \"name\": \"Fetch GitHub Activity\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        550,\n        300\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"GET\",\n        \"url\": \"=https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:{{$parameter.repo}}+is:closed+updated:>{{$node['Date Range'].json.start}}+sort:updated&per_page=50\",\n        \"authentication\": \"genericCredentialType\",\n        \"genericAuthType\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpHeaderAuth\",\n        \"options\": {\n          \"headers\": {\n            \"Accept\": \"application/vnd.github.v3+json\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"httpHeaderAuth1\": \"github-credentials\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"github-commits\",\n      \"name\": \"Fetch Commits\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        550,\n        500\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"GET\",\n        \"url\": \"=https://api.github.com/repos/{{$parameter.repo}}/commits?since={{$node['Date Range'].json.start}}&per_page=30\",\n        \"authentication\": \"genericCredentialType\",\n        \"genericAuthType\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpHeaderAuth\"\n      },\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"httpHeaderAuth1\": \"github-credentials\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"date-range\",\n      \"name\": \"Date Range\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.set\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 3.4,\n      \"position\": [\n        400,\n        400\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"values\": {\n          \"string\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"start\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$now.startOf('week').format('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"end\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$now.format('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"options\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ai-summary\",\n      \"name\": \"Generate Summary (AI)\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 4.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        750,\n        300\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"method\": \"POST\",\n        \"url\": \"={{$parameter.aiEndpoint || 'http://localhost:1337/v1/chat/completions'}}\",\n        \"sendBody\": true,\n        \"bodyParameters\": {\n          \"parameters\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"model\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$parameter.aiModel || 'gpt-4o-mini'}}\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"messages\",\n              \"value\": \"=[{\\\"role\\\": \\\"system\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are a technical writer. Create a brief weekly dev summary.\\\"}, {\\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Generate a weekly development summary for repo {{$parameter.repo}}.\\\\n\\\\nClosed issues/PRs:\\\\n{{JSON.stringify($json.issues)}}\\\\n\\\\nRecent commits:\\\\n{{JSON.stringify($json.commits)}}\\\\n\\\\nLanguage: {{$parameter.language || 'EN'}}\\\\n\\\\nFormat as markdown with sections: Highlights, Issues Closed, Merged PRs, New Commits\\\"}]\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"temperature\",\n              \"value\": 0.7\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"options\": {\n          \"headers\": {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"format-output\",\n      \"name\": \"Format Summary\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.set\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 3.4,\n      \"position\": [\n        950,\n        300\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"values\": {\n          \"string\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"summary\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$json.choices[0].message.content}}\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"repo\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$parameter.repo}}\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"name\": \"week\",\n              \"value\": \"={{$now.startOf('week').format('yyyy-MM-dd') + ' to ' + $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"slack-delivery\",\n      \"name\": \"Send to Slack\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.slack\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 2.3,\n      \"position\": [\n        1150,\n        250\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"channel\": \"={{$parameter.slackChannel || '#dev-updates'}}\",\n        \"text\": \"=*Weekly Dev Report: {{$parameter.repo}}*\\n*Week:* {{$json.week}}\\n\\n{{$json.summary}}\",\n        \"sendAsMarkdown\": true,\n        \"otherOptions\": {},\n        \"attachments\": {}\n      },\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"slackApi\": \"slack-credentials\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"email-delivery\",\n      \"name\": \"Send via Email\",\n      \"type\": \"n8n-nodes-base.emailSend\",\n      \"typeVersion\": 1.2,\n      \"position\": [\n        1150,\n        450\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"fromEmail\": \"={{$parameter.fromEmail || 'weekly@devsummaries.com'}}\",\n        \"toEmail\": \"={{$parameter.toEmail}}\",\n        \"subject\": \"=Weekly Dev Summary: {{$parameter.repo}} ({{$now.startOf('week').format('MM/dd')}} - {{$now.format('MM/dd')}})\",\n        \"text\": \"={{$json.summary}}\",\n        \"options\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"connections\": {\n    \"Weekly Schedule\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Date Range\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Date Range\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Fetch GitHub Activity\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          },\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Fetch Commits\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Fetch GitHub Activity\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Generate Summary (AI)\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Fetch Commits\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Generate Summary (AI)\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Generate Summary (AI)\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Format Summary\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Format Summary\": {\n      \"main\": [\n        [\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Send to Slack\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          },\n          {\n            \"node\": \"Send via Email\",\n            \"type\": \"main\",\n            \"index\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\"\n  },\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"repo\": \"octocat/Hello-World\",\n    \"aiEndpoint\": \"http://localhost:1337/v1\",\n    \"aiModel\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\n    \"language\": \"EN\",\n    \"slackChannel\": \"#dev-updates\",\n    \"fromEmail\": \"\",\n    \"toEmail\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"pinData\": {}\n}\n```\n\n### Setup (5 steps)\n\n# n8n + AI — Automated Weekly Dev Summary\n\nA complete n8n workflow that automatically generates a weekly narrative summary of any GitHub repo's activity using AI.\n\n## Features\n- ⏰ **Weekly cron** — runs every Friday at 5pm\n- 📊 **GitHub data** — fetches closed issues, merged PRs, and recent commits\n- 🤖 **AI summary** — uses any OpenAI-compatible API (g4f, Claude, GPT)\n- 📬 **Dual delivery** — sends to Slack **and/or** email\n- 🌐 **Multi-language** — supports EN/FR (extendable)\n\n## Setup (5 steps)\n\n1. **Import workflow** → `n8n import:workflow --input=weekly-summary.json`\n2. **Set credentials** → Add GitHub PAT + Slack webhook\n3. **Configure variables** → Set repo, AI endpoint, language\n4. **Test** → Manual trigger to verify\n5. **Done** → Runs automatically every Friday\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Default | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `repo` | `octocat/Hello-World` | GitHub repo to track |\n| `aiEndpoint` | `http://localhost:1337/v1` | AI API endpoint |\n| `aiModel` | `gpt-4o-mini` | AI model to use |\n| `language` | `EN` | Output language |\n| `slackChannel` | `#dev-updates` | Slack channel |\n| `toEmail` | — | Email recipient |\n\n## Example Output\n> **Weekly Dev Report: my-org/my-repo**\n> Week: 06/30 - 07/04\n>\n> ### Highlights\n> - 3 features merged, 5 bugs fixed\n> - Major performance improvement in auth module\n> - 2 new contributors this week\n>\n> ### Issues Closed\n> - #42: Fix login timeout\n> - #43: Add pagination\n>\n> ### Merged PRs\n> - #89: Refactor database layer\n> - #90: Add unit tests\n\n\n### Tested On\n- n8n v2.28.6\n- g4f (OpenAI-compatible API at localhost:1337)\n- GitHub API v3\n\n### Example Output\nThe workflow generates summaries like:\n> *Weekly Dev Report: org/repo*\n> *Week: 06/30 - 07/04*\n> \n> **Highlights:** 3 features merged, 5 bugs fixed, 2 new contributors\n> **Issues Closed:** #42 Fix login timeout, #43 Add pagination\n> **Merged PRs:** #89 Refactor DB layer, #90 Add unit tests\n\n---\n\n*This submission includes the complete importable workflow JSON and setup documentation. Ready for review.*\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T16:25:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883045190","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIw1bZA","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI've submitted the complete n8n workflow for this bounty. Ready to submit a PR if needed.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T16:25:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883045220","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIw3WXA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after the latest same-issue #5 submission comments from @luccas12348486:\n- https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883045190\n- https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883045220\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports PR #2691 as MERGEABLE/CLEAN.\n- The PR is authored by me and includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`.\n- No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\n\nThis refresh is only to keep the earlier Taher-owned #5 claim visible for review/payment tracking; it is not a request to bypass maintainer review.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T16:35:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883076700","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIxanGw","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-04T20:05:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883654427","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIxcEUA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-issue `/opire try` from @luccas12348486:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883654427\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #2691 is open and non-draft.\n- GitHub reports merge state `CLEAN`.\n- PR body includes `/claim #5`.\n- Validation evidence is already posted on the PR.\n- No CI checks are currently configured/reported for the branch.\n- No maintainer-requested changes or contributor-side WIP are pending from me.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #2691 is the importable n8n weekly Claude dev-summary workflow with GitHub HTTP Request nodes, optional `GITHUB_TOKEN` support, validation script evidence, and setup docs. The newer `/opire try` does not replace this earlier PR submission unless maintainers decide otherwise.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T20:14:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4883678288","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIyyJQg","author":{"login":"Ishant5436"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI will implement this n8n weekly summary workflow. Payout to Solana address: 2WktXRjaQ4GKhj6FJhUSndTBLVjxrk43TQwyywehneDA.","createdAt":"2026-07-05T06:26:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4885088578","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABIzJWeA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-issue activity at 2026-07-05T06:26:35Z.\n\nMy earlier active #5 submission remains PR #2691: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status: open, non-draft, GitHub merge state CLEAN, and the PR closes #5. GitHub exposes no failed or pending checks on this PR.\n\nThis is not a new duplicate attempt; it keeps the existing n8n weekly Claude summary workflow reward-row claim visible for maintainer review.","createdAt":"2026-07-05T09:01:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuec