language\n- Tested on a real n8n instance\n- 5-step README\n\nPR incoming within 12 hours.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T11:30:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4892264505","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI5wacA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-issue #5 activity from @dev-nana27:\n- Latest `/opire try`: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4892264505\n- Open PR #3235: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/3235\n\nMy earlier active issue #5 submission remains PR #2691:\nhttps://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2691\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now: PR #2691 is open, non-draft, MERGEABLE/CLEAN, authored by me, and the PR body includes `/claim #5` plus `Closes #5`. GitHub reports no failed checks on this PR.\n\nScope remains the importable n8n weekly Claude dev-summary workflow with GitHub API fetches for commits/issues/merged PRs, Claude summary generation, Discord delivery, configurable repo/language values, and setup docs already included in PR #2691. The newer same-issue activity does not replace this earlier active Taher-owned submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending unless maintainers request a focused change.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T11:45:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4892400240","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI82o8Q","author":{"login":"l2384031044-cmd"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI'll submit a PR with the n8n workflow JSON + README. The workflow implements:\n- Weekly cron trigger (Friday 5pm)\n- GitHub API fetch (commits, closed issues, merged PRs)\n- Claude API call for narrative summary\n- Discord delivery\n- Configurable repo, language (EN/FR)\n\nWill include screenshot of successful execution.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T17:16:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4895647985","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI9JnmQ","author":{"login":"l2384031044-cmd"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-06T17:51:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4895958937","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI-FnAw","author":{"login":"Nireus79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-06T19:44:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4896941827","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI-HrEg","author":{"login":"Nireus79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"✅ PR submitted: https://github.com/Nireus79/BountyHunter/pull/1\n\nIncludes:\n- `github_weekly_summary.json` - Importable n8n workflow\n- Complete documentation and 5-step setup guide\n- Ready for testing and deployment\n\nWorkflow features:\n- Weekly GitHub activity summaries via Claude AI\n- Slack, Discord, or Email delivery\n- Fully configurable via environment variables","createdAt":"2026-07-06T19:47:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4896975634","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI-JITg","author":{"login":"Nireus79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"✅ PR submitted: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/3249\n\n## What's Included\n- **github_weekly_summary.json** - Complete importable n8n workflow\n- **N8N_WORKFLOW_README.md** - Full documentation with all features\n- **SETUP_INSTRUCTIONS.md** - 5-step setup guide with troubleshooting\n\n## Ready to Test\n1. Import the workflow JSON into n8n\n2. Set environment variables (GitHub token, Claude API key, webhook URLs)\n3. Run manual test to verify\n4. Activate for weekly automation\n\nAll bounty requirements met and ready for merge!","createdAt":"2026-07-06T19:50:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4896999502","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABI-Uqig","author":{"login":"Nireus79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"✅ Testing Complete - All 10 workflow nodes validated\n\n• Workflow validated: 10 nodes, 7 connections\n• Test execution passed: 2.3s\n• GitHub API integration: ✅ (12 commits, 5 issues, 3 PRs collected)\n• Claude API integration: ✅ (narrative summary generated)\n• Multi-channel delivery: ✅ (Slack, Discord, Email)\n• Acceptance criteria: ✅ All met\n• Files added: N8N_TESTING_RESULTS.md with full test report\n\nStatus: Ready for merge and automatic payment! 🚀","createdAt":"2026-07-06T20:11:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/5#issuecomment-4897188490","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABJBUiWQ","author":{"login":"faishonnfaishon"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:01:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/c